| Asset | Path / prefix | Notes |
|-------|----------------|-------|
| Diagram texture | `Content/UI/Ship/` or `Content/Ship/UI/` — `T_<ShipType>_OutfitDiagram` | **2048×1024**, transparent; runtime may downscale. **8–10%** safe margin |
| WBP | `WBP_ShipOutfit` | Clean diagram — **no baked hotspot art**; slot widgets overlaid in Canvas |

- One diagram **per `ShipTypeId`**. v0 slot positions: **WBP manual** (see **3D asset pipeline §2D**). Normalized coords in DataTable — **later**.
- Resource may supply **reference** normalized slot coords (0–1); not authoritative until program stores them.

